RED — boundary, malformed/inherited state, and regression safety (criterion 2)

Command:
  bun test packages/senpi-task/src/team packages/senpi-task/src/runners/rpc packages/omo-senpi/src/components/task

Each edge below is proven by reverting its production guard in isolation and observing the named test
fail, then restoring the tree byte-identically.

1. A member process must expose ONLY its scoped task_send.
   Revert: the isTeamMemberProcess() early return.
   (fail) omo-senpi task component wiring > #given an explicit team member process #when the task
          component registers #then no lead task surface is wired
   The assertion pins toolNames/commands/messageRenderers/handlers all empty, so the member keeps only
   omo-member.js's scoped task_send.

2. Generic RPC descendants must NOT inherit member identity or omo-member.js.
   Revert: the MEMBER_PROCESS_ENV_NAMES strip.
   (fail) buildRpcSpawn spawn strategy > #given a generic child spawned by a member #when building
          #then member identity and extension do not leak

3. Explicit member launches must STILL receive fresh identity/config (positive control, unmutated).
   (pass) buildRpcSpawn spawn strategy > #given member extension env w2mem #when building #then
          identity config and task id reach the child without overriding isolation

4. Failure/exit paths must reach a terminal non-running status.
   Revert: terminal outcome classification.
   (fail) RpcProcessRunner > #given prior assistant text #when a revived turn produces no output
          #then the stale text cannot become a fresh success
   (fail) rpc turn outcome user abort classification (3 cases)

5. Malformed inherited wire state must not crash the host.
   Revert: the Array.isArray guard on the untrusted agent_end.messages.
   (fail) agentEndOutcome hostile wire payloads (4 cases)
   Unguarded, this threw TypeError out of the onEvent listener into the Node stream data handler,
   i.e. an uncaught exception in the PARENT host process.

6. Curated read-only output bounded without changing normal output.
   Shipped and merged separately in PR #6879 (packages/senpi-task/src/runners/in-process/
